    <ferc:FormType id="f-878" contextRef="c-02">2-A</ferc:FormType>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfSubsequentEventsTextBlock id="f-880" contextRef="c-02">&lt;p&gt;14. On January 26, 2026, Scout V Hugoton Gathering, LP signed a purchase and sale agreement to sell the WTG Hugoton Pipeline for an estimated sales price of $2 million. The closing date is schedule for April 30, 2026 with an effective date of January 1, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSubsequentEventsTextBlock>
